# Trivy ignore file — Enterprise Security Policy
#
# RULES:
# - Only add CVEs that have NO fix available from upstream vendor
# - Every entry MUST include an expiry date (max 90 days)
# - Review all entries quarterly — remove if fix becomes available
# - Document the reason and tracking ticket
#
# FORMAT:
# # CVE-XXXX-XXXX — reason / ticket / expiry:YYYY-MM-DD
